# An allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else stays out,
# above all data/cuad/test.json, CUADv1.json and cuad-v1.zip, which contain the test contracts.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!requirements-demo.txt
!requirements-server.txt
!clausetriage/
!scripts/
!.github/scripts/prefetch_hf_assets.py
!data/cuad/category_descriptions.csv
!data/cuad/train_separate_questions.json
!data/demo_contracts/
!results/word_char_tfidf_nested/word_char_tfidf_thresholds.json
# The released model file, if you have it (it is git-ignored); otherwise the build downloads or builds it
!models/word_char_tfidf.joblib
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
